WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:33.720
What a so-called "righteous official"
serving the people!

01:34.320 --> 01:36.280
Oppressing the people in broad daylight,

01:36.360 --> 01:38.440
ignoring their grievances.

01:38.520 --> 01:39.880
Today it's the Ji family,

01:39.960 --> 01:42.680
who knows whose misfortune
it will be tomorrow.

01:43.280 --> 01:45.360
Ji Yaoting sought justice for his mother.

01:45.440 --> 01:47.920
That's reasonable and justified,
yet he suffered punishment.

01:48.000 --> 01:49.880
If one day we are wronged,

01:49.960 --> 01:52.160
won't we follow
in the Ji family's footsteps,

01:52.240 --> 01:54.440
with no place to appeal our grievances?

01:54.520 --> 01:56.320
- Exactly!
- Exactly!

01:56.400 --> 01:58.120
‪-Indeed!
‪-Exactly!

01:58.200 --> 01:59.960
- Indeed!
- Right!

02:02.800 --> 02:04.280
- Who is it?
- It's me!

02:04.360 --> 02:05.840
Make way!

02:05.920 --> 02:07.240
Yaoting!

02:07.320 --> 02:09.080
- Yaoting!
- Yaoting!

02:09.160 --> 02:10.759
- You all…
- Yaoting!

02:10.840 --> 02:11.960
You…

02:13.840 --> 02:16.280
I have arranged for storytellers
to spread the word in town.

02:16.360 --> 02:17.600
Starting today,

02:17.680 --> 02:19.960
everyone will know
what happened to our Ji family.

02:20.040 --> 02:23.320
Let's see if the governor has the ability
to silence everyone!

02:23.400 --> 02:24.880
No need to go through such trouble!

02:24.960 --> 02:26.960
Do you think
this Imperial Uncle is just for show?

02:27.800 --> 02:30.560
I'll write a direct petition
to the emperor.

02:30.640 --> 02:34.360
Let's see if the governor
can silence even the emperor!

02:35.600 --> 02:38.520
No justice for grievances!
The governor is unjust!

02:38.600 --> 02:43.640
No justice for grievances!
The governor is unjust!

02:43.720 --> 02:45.040
Stop shouting!

02:45.120 --> 02:47.320
Close your mouths!

02:50.000 --> 02:50.920
Close your mouth first.

02:52.800 --> 02:53.680
A bunch of fools!

02:54.280 --> 02:55.640
Who ordered you to use excessive force?

02:55.720 --> 02:58.040
Didn't I tell you to give
a minor punishment as a warning?

03:04.040 --> 03:05.240
Yaoting…

03:08.920 --> 03:11.360
Ji Yaoting, you stormed into the bureau

03:11.440 --> 03:12.640
and caused a scene,

03:12.720 --> 03:14.320
leaving me no choice but to punish you!

03:14.400 --> 03:15.840
However, considering your dedication

03:15.920 --> 03:17.880
to seeking justice for your mother
and your sincerity,

03:17.960 --> 03:21.120
regardless of the case's truth,
your filial piety is commendable.

03:22.280 --> 03:24.400
I am not someone

03:24.480 --> 03:26.040
who disregards humanity
for the sake of the law.

03:26.720 --> 03:30.080
Since your mother is ill,
I will make an exception,

03:30.160 --> 03:32.080
allowing you to deliver
medicine to her in prison once.

03:36.920 --> 03:37.880
As for the case,

03:38.480 --> 03:39.880
once your mother recovers,

03:39.960 --> 03:43.480
I will do my utmost
to bring it to trial promptly.

03:44.640 --> 03:45.680
Thank you, Governor.

03:47.840 --> 03:48.920
Governor, you're wise!

03:50.280 --> 03:51.120
Indeed, wise, my lord.

03:52.640 --> 03:53.800
What a disgrace!

03:53.880 --> 03:55.280
THE RESIDENCE OF YIZHOU'S GOVERNOR

03:55.360 --> 03:56.560
Yaoting…

03:56.640 --> 03:58.760
- Folks, disperse now!
- Yaoting…

03:58.840 --> 04:00.080
Let's go back!

04:00.160 --> 04:01.400
I'm fine.

04:03.080 --> 04:04.400
Yaoting…

04:05.720 --> 04:06.560
I'm fine.

04:06.640 --> 04:08.320
Yaoting, didn't you say

04:09.400 --> 04:11.400
a gentleman avoids dangerous situations?

04:11.480 --> 04:13.240
But with our family in crisis,

04:13.760 --> 04:14.920
someone has to step up.

04:18.000 --> 04:18.839
Yingying…

04:19.640 --> 04:20.480
Yaoting…

04:23.200 --> 04:24.120
I'm fine.

04:25.160 --> 04:26.360
Go quickly and check on Mother.

04:27.040 --> 04:28.400
See how she's doing.

04:29.240 --> 04:30.400
Hurry.

04:31.280 --> 04:32.720
Go on!

04:33.320 --> 04:34.480
Just go.

04:34.560 --> 04:35.840
We've got things covered here.

04:45.520 --> 04:47.200
- Greetings, Warden Wang.
- Open the door.

04:47.280 --> 04:48.160
Yes.

04:52.840 --> 04:53.680
Mother!

04:54.640 --> 04:55.880
Mother!

04:57.920 --> 05:00.440
Warden Wang, my mother is gravely ill.

05:00.520 --> 05:01.680
I brought medicine.

05:01.760 --> 05:03.680
Could you help us prepare it?

05:03.760 --> 05:04.840
That's not allowed.

05:13.480 --> 05:14.320
Just this once.

05:14.400 --> 05:15.360
Thank you.

05:15.440 --> 05:16.280
Go in.

05:17.520 --> 05:18.600
Mother!

05:19.320 --> 05:20.160
Mother!

05:22.120 --> 05:23.160
Mother!

05:25.800 --> 05:27.000
Mother!

05:28.760 --> 05:29.600
Yingying…

05:30.200 --> 05:31.880
- Mother!
- Yingying!

05:40.800 --> 05:41.840
- Mother.
- Yingying.

05:42.360 --> 05:44.320
Why are you here?

05:45.560 --> 05:46.560
Mother,

05:47.160 --> 05:48.640
I came late.

05:50.120 --> 05:51.560
No, Yingying.

05:52.160 --> 05:54.080
I'm fine. I'm fine.

05:54.160 --> 05:57.680
You're this ill, and you say you're fine?

05:58.320 --> 05:59.480
It's nothing.

06:01.320 --> 06:02.640
Don't cry, Yingying.

06:03.480 --> 06:04.320
Yingying,

06:05.360 --> 06:06.840
I didn't kill anyone.

06:07.720 --> 06:09.760
How could I harm my own sister?

06:09.840 --> 06:11.160
I didn't kill anyone.

06:11.240 --> 06:13.040
I know.

06:13.120 --> 06:14.960
There must be some mistake.

06:15.560 --> 06:17.440
Don't worry, Mother.

06:17.520 --> 06:19.360
I've uncovered some clues,

06:19.440 --> 06:21.040
and I'll get you out of here.

06:25.640 --> 06:26.960
Yingying,

06:27.760 --> 06:28.960
I've been thinking

06:29.520 --> 06:32.560
about that day these past few days.

06:33.240 --> 06:36.520
But I just can't make sense of it.

06:37.400 --> 06:40.560
I'll tell you now.
Help me think it through.

06:43.800 --> 06:44.880
That day,

06:45.960 --> 06:48.760
I went to pay off your uncle's debt.

06:48.840 --> 06:49.880
Then…

06:56.040 --> 06:57.200
Are you okay?

06:58.120 --> 07:00.480
Here, take a seat.

07:04.040 --> 07:04.920
Slowly.

07:07.200 --> 07:09.040
But I never imagined

07:09.120 --> 07:10.880
that when I woke up,

07:12.040 --> 07:14.600
I'd be holding my own hairpin

07:15.400 --> 07:16.800
covered in blood.

07:16.880 --> 07:18.680
It was all blood.

07:18.760 --> 07:21.040
Mother, I already know.

07:22.280 --> 07:24.240
Leave the rest to us.

07:24.320 --> 07:27.680
The most important thing now
is to take care of yourself.

07:34.160 --> 07:35.760
It's fine.

07:35.840 --> 07:37.160
By the way,

07:37.240 --> 07:38.600
how is everything at home?

07:38.680 --> 07:40.040
How's Yaoting?

07:40.880 --> 07:42.840
Everything at home is fine.

07:43.880 --> 07:46.600
The Governor only allowed one visitor.

07:46.680 --> 07:49.040
Yaoting and Gui
are waiting for you at home.

07:58.760 --> 08:00.840
We'll definitely get you out of here.

08:03.200 --> 08:05.080
Then, our family will reunite.

08:09.960 --> 08:11.320
I believe in you.

08:12.400 --> 08:13.840
I believe in you.

08:26.320 --> 08:27.400
Here, let me put some medicine on it.

08:28.760 --> 08:29.640
I'll do it myself.

08:31.720 --> 08:34.240
That day, I never said
I wouldn't be friends with you anymore.

08:34.320 --> 08:36.000
I don't mind at all.
Why are you so stubborn?

08:37.240 --> 08:38.120
Give me your hand.

08:45.840 --> 08:47.120
Don't move.

08:47.200 --> 08:49.120
If you don't treat
your hands properly, they'll be ruined.

09:07.760 --> 09:08.720
Say something if it hurts.

09:09.920 --> 09:10.760
It hurts.

09:10.840 --> 09:12.000
Why did you go there?

09:13.120 --> 09:14.400
If your hands are ruined,

09:14.480 --> 09:16.320
you won't be able to weave
brocade again in this lifetime.

09:16.920 --> 09:19.280
You'll never be able
to do what you love most.

09:21.840 --> 09:22.920
Switch hands.

09:26.720 --> 09:29.640
The Ji family's rule
is the brocade comes first,

09:29.720 --> 09:30.720
but people are above brocade.

09:31.800 --> 09:33.040
Compared to human life,

09:33.120 --> 09:34.640
no matter how precious
the brocade, it's insignificant.

09:35.680 --> 09:37.280
As long as I can
protect the people I care about,

09:37.960 --> 09:39.720
even if my hands are ruined,

09:40.480 --> 09:41.640
I won't regret it.

09:42.680 --> 09:45.720
Your family's rule
is quite different from his.

09:46.720 --> 09:48.040
Whose family?

09:48.840 --> 09:49.880
If you're ever in trouble,

09:49.960 --> 09:52.360
I'd do the same for you, without regret!

09:59.240 --> 10:01.200
I… I didn't mean
to curse you with trouble.

10:08.000 --> 10:09.080
Apply medicine once a day.

10:09.160 --> 10:10.880
Avoid water for three days.

10:13.800 --> 10:15.160
Did you hear me?

10:16.760 --> 10:17.760
Yes.

10:21.160 --> 10:22.120
Thank you.

10:25.760 --> 10:27.200
Even though you were reckless today,

10:27.840 --> 10:32.240
you're a man
with courage and responsibility.

10:47.920 --> 10:50.960
TANGCHANG COUNTY MAGISTRATE

11:01.680 --> 11:02.520
Yingying,

11:03.920 --> 11:05.440
how is Mrs. Ji's illness?

11:07.880 --> 11:10.160
Those few doses
of medicine won't cure her.

11:10.240 --> 11:12.080
Conditions inside are terrible,

11:12.160 --> 11:13.560
and she's anxious and unsettled.

11:13.640 --> 11:15.000
How could she recover like this?

11:15.840 --> 11:17.400
This can't be delayed any longer.

11:17.480 --> 11:19.720
We must get her out quickly. Otherwise…

11:24.280 --> 11:26.360
Bloom Society can help
with business matters,

11:27.360 --> 11:29.320
but as for rescuing Mrs. Ji,

11:29.400 --> 11:30.600
I'm your only option.

11:30.680 --> 11:31.680
Only I can help you.

11:34.040 --> 11:35.480
I have only one condition.

11:35.560 --> 11:37.120
As long as you promise me

11:37.680 --> 11:39.040
you'll stay by my side forever.

11:39.120 --> 11:42.240
If you agree, I'll get Mrs. Ji out today

11:42.320 --> 11:43.360
and treat her illness.

11:44.640 --> 11:46.840
My mother didn't kill anyone.

11:46.920 --> 11:48.680
I just need to find the real culprit,

11:48.760 --> 11:49.920
and she'll be freed from prison.

11:50.000 --> 11:52.560
I can wait until
you find the real culprit,

11:52.640 --> 11:54.520
but can Mrs. Ji's health wait for you?

11:59.800 --> 12:01.200
I really can help you.

12:04.000 --> 12:05.760
You're Niu Jin's favored son-in-law.

12:05.840 --> 12:08.120
Niu Jin and I are sworn enemies.

12:08.200 --> 12:10.040
Using his influence to help me,

12:10.120 --> 12:11.400
don't you find that laughable?

12:13.600 --> 12:15.360
I found it laughable once too.

12:16.560 --> 12:18.720
But now,
you are just like I was back then.

12:19.560 --> 12:22.680
In the face of power,
neither of us has another choice.

12:24.400 --> 12:25.920
Now, do you understand me?

12:27.400 --> 12:28.440
I don't understand.

12:41.320 --> 12:43.080
But if you want to be my friend,

12:43.160 --> 12:44.080
there's only one condition.

12:44.160 --> 12:45.520
Be sincere.

12:47.640 --> 12:49.240
You're not someone

12:49.320 --> 12:51.040
who'd make a friend
willing to die for you.

12:54.280 --> 12:55.560
Sir.

12:58.200 --> 12:59.520
Sir.

12:59.600 --> 13:01.280
Niu Jin sent a message.

13:01.360 --> 13:02.560
He wants to meet you outside the city.

13:04.720 --> 13:06.680
Understood. Leave now.

13:07.280 --> 13:08.240
Yes, sir.

13:15.320 --> 13:17.240
You and I were never on the same side.

13:18.920 --> 13:20.920
Naturally, we can't
be sincere to each other.

13:37.200 --> 13:38.080
Sit.

13:39.640 --> 13:40.840
Gao,

13:40.920 --> 13:42.880
did you see Prince Bai last night?

13:45.760 --> 13:47.920
I was just pretending to be an assassin,
not a real one.

13:48.000 --> 13:49.000
Why would I meet him?

13:50.280 --> 13:51.280
What's wrong?

13:51.360 --> 13:52.480
Is something off?

13:54.000 --> 13:56.800
I heard that Ning Dai
is deeply devoted to Prince Bai.

13:57.400 --> 13:58.280
When an assassin broke into the residence,

13:58.360 --> 14:00.760
she didn't protect the prince
but came after me.

14:00.840 --> 14:04.240
That either means
her feelings for the prince are fake,

14:04.320 --> 14:05.680
or…

14:05.760 --> 14:07.440
Prince Bai himself is an imposter.

14:34.200 --> 14:35.400
Last night at Prince Bai's residence,

14:35.480 --> 14:38.360
I saw the newly developed
Rippling Grain Brocade.

14:39.360 --> 14:42.400
Now, the one secretly
putting a bounty on my head

14:42.480 --> 14:43.440
knows my name is Yang Jinglan

14:43.520 --> 14:44.960
and even recognizes my appearance.

14:45.560 --> 14:47.200
Don't you find that strange?

14:49.000 --> 14:49.840
And also,

14:50.560 --> 14:51.600
Ning Dai

14:52.120 --> 14:53.960
identified me as Yang Jinglan
just by my voice.

14:54.040 --> 14:55.320
That means she's been to Yizhou.

14:56.120 --> 14:57.440
So, I suspect

14:57.520 --> 15:01.040
the real Prince Bai is now in Yizhou.

15:02.280 --> 15:03.920
In the 13th year of Yuanhe,

15:04.000 --> 15:06.520
I gifted Prince Bai of Nanzhao a brocade.

15:12.960 --> 15:14.240
Alright.

15:14.320 --> 15:15.960
Give me a moment to think.

15:17.560 --> 15:18.560
It features Jingyanggong patterns,

15:18.640 --> 15:20.040
floral trees paired with deer motifs.

15:20.120 --> 15:22.280
That was the Yang family's new brocade.

15:22.360 --> 15:25.840
However, you didn't gift just one piece

15:25.920 --> 15:27.280
but an entire chest.

15:29.640 --> 15:30.760
In the third year of Yuanhe…

15:30.840 --> 15:32.680
You gifted the Four
Heavenly Kings Hunting Lions Brocade.

15:33.480 --> 15:35.440
Back then, I was still young.

15:35.520 --> 15:38.440
You were doing business with my master.

15:39.880 --> 15:44.120
I remember it was the 10th year of Yuanhe
when I took over.

15:56.000 --> 15:57.120
Greetings, Prince Bai.

15:57.880 --> 15:59.320
General, please.

16:06.040 --> 16:08.400
I'm in a risky position right now

16:08.480 --> 16:10.320
and must act with caution.

16:10.400 --> 16:11.600
I hope Your Majesty understand.

16:13.040 --> 16:15.040
Such prudence

16:15.120 --> 16:16.720
is what pleases me.

16:18.760 --> 16:20.440
It was my oversight,

16:20.520 --> 16:22.880
or how could I trouble Your Majesty

16:22.960 --> 16:24.080
to come to Yizhou personally
to collect brocade?

16:24.160 --> 16:26.680
But for future transactions…

16:27.920 --> 16:30.280
Even the finest brocade
cannot surpass tribute brocade.

16:30.880 --> 16:32.640
Once the storm has passed,

16:32.720 --> 16:35.120
I shall celebrate with you, General.

16:37.360 --> 16:38.480
This visit

16:38.560 --> 16:40.720
is to discuss our collaboration.

16:40.800 --> 16:42.840
If we can open trade routes in the future,

16:43.520 --> 16:46.040
then the transactions between us

16:46.120 --> 16:47.320
will naturally proceed smoothly.

16:48.200 --> 16:49.480
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

16:49.560 --> 16:52.000
As for the escort,
I will take full responsibility.

16:55.720 --> 16:57.400
But I've also heard

16:57.480 --> 17:00.280
Your Majesty have taken an interest
in Ji Yingying.

17:01.160 --> 17:03.320
You risked your life
to save her from a fire.

17:04.400 --> 17:05.960
If Your Majesty truly fancy her,

17:06.040 --> 17:08.800
I could have
my foolish son-in-law let her go.

17:11.440 --> 17:12.920
Ji Yingying…

17:13.680 --> 17:16.640
Currently, she's the only one
capable of dyeing Shu Red Silk.

17:16.720 --> 17:20.040
If she were to die so easily,
wouldn't that be a pity?

17:21.599 --> 17:25.680
I believe that's why you
haven't rushed to eliminate her.

17:27.520 --> 17:30.520
By the way,
there's one more thing to inform you.

17:31.320 --> 17:33.240
An assassin from the Tang Empire

17:33.320 --> 17:35.600
is relentlessly pursuing
the smuggled tribute brocade.

17:36.360 --> 17:38.560
He even went to Nanzhao

17:38.640 --> 17:40.160
and made a scene in my Brocade Vault.

17:40.760 --> 17:43.920
In your opinion, who could this person be?

17:45.200 --> 17:46.440
It's Yang Jinglan.

17:48.440 --> 17:50.560
On the surface,
he returns to Chang'an to report,

17:50.640 --> 17:52.680
but in reality, he advances secretly.

17:54.600 --> 17:55.800
All right.

17:55.880 --> 17:59.040
Since he went to Nanzhao,
he should never return.

17:59.120 --> 18:00.960
Rest assured, Your Majesty.
I'll make arrangements immediately.

18:01.560 --> 18:04.600
All you need to do now

18:04.680 --> 18:07.640
is guard the official road
from Yizhou to Nanzhao.

18:08.320 --> 18:10.160
On the Nanzhao side,
I've set up an inescapable trap.

18:10.240 --> 18:13.440
If he dares to show up, he won't escape.

18:16.720 --> 18:17.600
Here.

18:18.240 --> 18:20.840
Zhuge had someone
deliver it from Yizhou City.

18:22.640 --> 18:24.280
Yizhou hasn't really
encountered trouble, has it?

18:29.000 --> 18:31.000
MS. JI'S IN TROUBLE, RETURN QUICKLY

18:32.040 --> 18:34.240
No, I must return to Yizhou.

18:35.680 --> 18:38.600
Gao, find someone
to draw a portrait of Prince Bai.

18:38.680 --> 18:40.480
I want to know
if he's the person I think he is.

18:40.560 --> 18:41.560
I'm heading back now.

18:43.800 --> 18:45.160
Out there, both openly and in secret,

18:45.240 --> 18:46.520
it's full of people sent
by Prince Bai to kill you.

18:46.600 --> 18:48.120
Are you sure you want to return now?

18:48.200 --> 18:50.240
I promised her I would stand by her side.

18:50.960 --> 18:52.480
No matter the dangers,

18:52.560 --> 18:53.920
I have to go back.

18:54.000 --> 18:55.040
I'm leaving now.

19:01.920 --> 19:08.880
YANG RESIDENCE

19:15.040 --> 19:16.280
What brings you here?

19:16.840 --> 19:18.360
Please inform Mrs. Yang

19:18.440 --> 19:20.000
that Ji Yingying
from Bloom Society seeks an audience.

19:21.080 --> 19:22.320
Miss, please wait here.

19:34.680 --> 19:37.080
Greetings, Mrs. Yang.

19:40.080 --> 19:43.640
Ms. Ji, what brings you here today?

19:44.800 --> 19:47.560
I've come today
to propose a business deal with you.

19:49.640 --> 19:52.120
I've heard about
the Ji family's misfortune.

19:53.040 --> 19:56.080
What kind of business deal
do you have in mind?

20:07.760 --> 20:10.720
I want to discuss a deal
regarding the Rippling Grain Brocade.

20:13.520 --> 20:15.720
What do you propose?

20:16.440 --> 20:19.400
I wonder if you've heard
that I've taken an order

20:20.080 --> 20:22.240
for 30 bolts of Ripple Brocade
with dragon and beast patterns

20:22.320 --> 20:24.360
at 30% above the market price.

20:24.440 --> 20:26.600
I have to complete them
within five months.

20:27.120 --> 20:29.160
But now, my family's workshop
has burned down,

20:29.240 --> 20:30.640
and all the raw silk is destroyed.

20:32.560 --> 20:34.360
What do you mean, Ms. Ji?

20:35.400 --> 20:37.200
I recall that at the auction,

20:37.280 --> 20:39.680
you seemed very interested
in the Ripple Brocade.

20:41.200 --> 20:44.040
Are you planning to sell
the Ripple Brocade design

20:44.120 --> 20:45.320
to my family?

20:46.720 --> 20:49.640
The Ripple Brocade
was co-developed by me and Mr. Yu.

20:49.720 --> 20:50.720
I have no right to sell it.

20:52.040 --> 20:55.120
However, if you are willing
to help me in this critical moment,

20:55.200 --> 20:58.360
in addition to sharing the profits
from this order,

20:58.440 --> 21:01.880
I am also willing to collaborate
with your family on new brocade designs.

21:03.080 --> 21:05.360
I trust your talent,

21:06.120 --> 21:09.160
but the future is always uncertain.

21:10.040 --> 21:14.040
True. So, I've brought
something else as well today.

21:27.320 --> 21:29.440
I'm willing to teach the Yang family

21:29.520 --> 21:31.640
all the methods for dyeing Shu Red Silk.

22:04.400 --> 22:09.000
For you to take such a drastic step,

22:10.000 --> 22:13.840
it must not just be about the order.

22:15.800 --> 22:16.640
Indeed.

22:17.920 --> 22:19.480
I've also come

22:20.160 --> 22:21.960
for the sake of my mother today.

22:23.640 --> 22:24.840
Everyone knows

22:24.920 --> 22:27.640
that your elder brother
was adopted by his uncle

22:27.720 --> 22:29.880
and now works in Chang'an.

22:29.960 --> 22:32.360
If you could ask him for help,

22:32.440 --> 22:33.800
he could certainly save my mother.

22:35.480 --> 22:36.480
Ms. Ji,

22:37.720 --> 22:40.160
you and I both know who you've offended.

22:42.200 --> 22:43.240
If I help you,

22:43.840 --> 22:46.680
then my Yang family
will surely be pushed into the spotlight.

22:47.880 --> 22:50.080
While Shu Red Silk is valuable,

22:50.760 --> 22:54.520
this deal carries a significant risk.

22:57.280 --> 22:59.240
If Shu Red Silk isn't enough,
I also have Flushed Rose.

22:59.320 --> 23:01.960
In the future, I'll create
even more new colors.

23:02.520 --> 23:05.080
If you feel the deal lacks weight,

23:05.160 --> 23:07.880
I can continue adding more chips

23:09.080 --> 23:10.520
until you're satisfied.

23:14.400 --> 23:16.480
Relying on the Yang family's influence

23:16.560 --> 23:18.360
might protect you for now,

23:18.440 --> 23:19.920
but it won't shield you forever.

23:21.600 --> 23:23.040
It may offer short-term safety,

23:23.840 --> 23:25.000
but not lifelong security.

23:27.720 --> 23:29.040
Unless…

23:32.800 --> 23:36.000
you find yourself a lasting support.

23:37.480 --> 23:39.040
Are you suggesting…

23:40.480 --> 23:42.080
For the Yang family

23:42.800 --> 23:45.560
to take on
the Ji family's burden legitimately

23:45.640 --> 23:48.080
and for you to have
no worries in the future,

23:49.000 --> 23:50.080
there's only one solution.

23:50.160 --> 23:51.480
What solution?

23:52.880 --> 23:55.520
I propose that my second son,
Yang Jinglin,

23:56.120 --> 23:57.320
marry you.

24:16.920 --> 24:18.840
As the head lady of the Yang family,

24:20.160 --> 24:21.240
I dare say

24:21.320 --> 24:25.480
our Yang family
has the courage to take this gamble.

24:26.680 --> 24:29.640
Naturally, I hope you will agree.

24:33.280 --> 24:34.840
But as a woman,

24:37.160 --> 24:39.160
I must advise you to think carefully.

24:41.840 --> 24:43.480
After all, marriage

24:46.240 --> 24:47.800
concerns a woman's entire life.

25:09.280 --> 25:11.200
Right now, the most urgent matter for you

25:11.280 --> 25:13.360
is not business,

25:13.440 --> 25:16.120
but your mother.

25:16.200 --> 25:18.880
I can wait for you
to find the true culprit,

25:18.960 --> 25:20.880
but can Mrs. Ji's health wait for you?

25:28.440 --> 25:29.880
What I want is…

25:30.680 --> 25:31.680
you.

25:31.760 --> 25:33.240
As long as you agree

25:33.920 --> 25:35.160
to stay by my side forever…

26:04.520 --> 26:05.360
I agree.

26:08.240 --> 26:09.280
Are you certain?

26:10.080 --> 26:11.280
To be honest,

26:12.240 --> 26:14.440
your family wasn't my first choice.

26:16.600 --> 26:17.760
The others

26:17.840 --> 26:20.960
either required me to fake civility
to mend broken ties

26:22.040 --> 26:24.680
or forced me to leave my hometown

26:24.760 --> 26:25.960
and sell myself into servanthood.

26:27.200 --> 26:30.320
By comparison,
the Yang family can save my mother

26:30.840 --> 26:32.600
and let me stay in Yizhou.

26:33.480 --> 26:35.040
This is already the best option.

26:37.680 --> 26:38.800
These days,

26:39.400 --> 26:41.320
my friends have been working tirelessly

26:41.920 --> 26:43.560
to help me repay debts.

26:44.760 --> 26:46.680
My brother, seeking justice,

26:46.760 --> 26:48.280
has endured great suffering

26:48.360 --> 26:49.760
without fearing authority.

26:51.640 --> 26:53.240
All I have to do is marry someone,

26:53.880 --> 26:55.880
and it's to a family like yours.

26:55.960 --> 26:57.040
What grievance is there in that?

27:01.000 --> 27:01.880
Good.

27:04.760 --> 27:05.840
Good.

27:05.920 --> 27:06.920
Rest assured.

27:07.000 --> 27:08.440
Once you marry into the Yang family,

27:09.080 --> 27:11.040
you'll be a proper daughter-in-law.

27:11.120 --> 27:12.760
The Yang family will not mistreat you.

27:12.840 --> 27:14.520
As for your wedding,

27:14.600 --> 27:16.440
I'll ensure it's lively and grand,

27:16.520 --> 27:18.480
worthy of the Ji family's honor.

27:20.080 --> 27:23.480
But my mother is still in prison,
gravely ill.

27:23.560 --> 27:25.640
I fear she can't hold on much longer.

27:26.440 --> 27:30.360
Please set the wedding date quickly,
without complications.

27:33.680 --> 27:35.160
Your filial piety

27:35.760 --> 27:36.960
is something I cannot refuse.

27:38.440 --> 27:41.000
I'll send someone to make
the necessary arrangements

27:41.080 --> 27:43.720
to get Mrs. Ji out of prison
as soon as possible.

27:45.040 --> 27:47.040
As for Mr. Qian's matter,

27:48.240 --> 27:50.760
the Yang family will provide
the silk and dyes,

27:50.840 --> 27:52.960
ensuring the new brocade
is completed on time.

27:59.960 --> 28:01.080
Thank you.

28:06.840 --> 28:09.760
- The Yang family is truly shameless!
- Yu! Yu!

28:09.840 --> 28:11.280
This is already the best choice.

28:11.360 --> 28:12.320
They've gone too far!

28:12.400 --> 28:13.880
For the Yang family,
it's always just about business.

28:14.520 --> 28:15.560
Yu!

28:17.040 --> 28:17.960
Ms. Yu.

28:18.760 --> 28:19.640
Ms. Yu!

28:20.280 --> 28:22.520
Stay here and keep watch.
I'll go inform Mr. Yang Jingshan.

28:22.600 --> 28:23.560
Yuniang,

28:24.160 --> 28:26.320
the Yang family
has never been just mine alone.

28:26.920 --> 28:28.280
If my mother agrees to this,

28:28.360 --> 28:30.720
it surely aligns
with the wishes of the family elders.

28:31.960 --> 28:33.680
No matter what, I cannot change this.

28:33.760 --> 28:35.240
The family elders?

28:35.840 --> 28:37.600
With Yingying's personality,
marrying into your family

28:37.680 --> 28:39.440
and following your rules

28:39.520 --> 28:41.320
would be no different from imprisonment.

28:41.920 --> 28:44.680
The Yang family chose Ms. Ji
for her abilities.

28:44.760 --> 28:46.680
She isn't marrying in to be a housewife.

28:47.480 --> 28:49.880
My mother will have her help
manage the family business together.

28:49.960 --> 28:53.360
So, this marriage contract
is nothing but a bondage agreement,

28:53.440 --> 28:56.040
buying Yingying's entire life
to work in your Yang family?

28:56.680 --> 28:59.720
I know Ms. Ji is your best friend.

29:00.440 --> 29:02.640
But things have come to this,
and there's no turning back.

29:03.680 --> 29:04.800
Once she marries into my family,

29:04.880 --> 29:06.400
I will do my utmost to protect her.

29:08.600 --> 29:09.560
Protect her?

29:10.880 --> 29:11.960
You can protect her?

29:13.440 --> 29:14.560
You can't protect anyone.

29:15.440 --> 29:17.920
It was true eight years ago,
and it's true now!

29:19.600 --> 29:21.040
If Yingying suffers in your Yang family,

29:21.120 --> 29:22.680
I'll burn the Yang family to the ground!

29:22.760 --> 29:24.680
I, Yu Linglong, mean what I say.

29:25.480 --> 29:31.440
NANZHAO

29:44.520 --> 29:46.320
On guard! Quickly!

29:46.400 --> 29:47.360
Archers, prepare!

29:47.440 --> 29:49.440
Hurry! On guard!

30:25.920 --> 30:26.920
Close the gate!

31:36.040 --> 31:36.960
Spears ready!

31:39.600 --> 31:40.720
Attack!

31:51.600 --> 31:52.440
NANZHAO

32:27.880 --> 32:30.200
My mother always wanted me to get married.

32:32.160 --> 32:33.520
Now she can finally have her wish.

32:36.720 --> 32:39.680
But sadly, she won't see
what I look like as a bride.

32:41.880 --> 32:42.840
If your heart aches,

32:43.680 --> 32:44.840
don't smile.

32:45.880 --> 32:48.680
When you choose your own path,
you must walk it with a smile.

32:49.880 --> 32:51.800
What's the point of crying

32:52.480 --> 32:54.600
and giving those
who hurt me a reason to laugh?

33:05.720 --> 33:07.400
Are you really not waiting
for Yang Jinglan to return?

33:09.400 --> 33:13.080
Yang Jinglan, I'll wait for your return!

33:21.920 --> 33:24.200
My mother's health has always been poor,

33:24.920 --> 33:26.520
and I can't gamble with her life.

33:30.880 --> 33:32.800
Last time, he and I missed our chance.

33:37.280 --> 33:40.360
This time, I don't have the time
to wait for him.

33:42.800 --> 33:45.040
Perhaps we're not fated to be together.

33:50.240 --> 33:51.240
Yu,

33:54.160 --> 33:55.200
honestly,

33:55.800 --> 33:58.440
marrying someone
you don't love isn't always a bad thing.

34:00.600 --> 34:01.680
Ordinary women

34:02.560 --> 34:04.760
serve their husbands
in the inner chambers,

34:04.840 --> 34:06.200
competing for favor.

34:07.200 --> 34:08.400
But I won't have to.

34:09.400 --> 34:11.880
Both the Yang family and I
understand this is a transaction.

34:13.040 --> 34:15.000
I won't have to deal
with household conflicts.

34:16.040 --> 34:18.639
I can learn business from Mrs. Yang.

34:19.480 --> 34:20.600
She's so capable,

34:21.199 --> 34:23.400
I'm sure I can learn a lot from her.

34:26.679 --> 34:27.639
Are these words

34:28.600 --> 34:29.920
truly from your heart?

34:38.679 --> 34:41.400
We both know this is the best choice.

34:45.040 --> 34:48.600
I don't want my brother or Pin
to know about this too soon.

34:49.760 --> 34:51.480
You're the only one who can help me.

35:02.400 --> 35:03.360
Alright,

35:04.600 --> 35:05.440
I'll help you.

35:39.880 --> 35:40.960
Yang Jinglan!

35:41.560 --> 35:43.240
I'll wait for your return!

35:50.480 --> 35:51.560
Yang Jinglan…

35:54.160 --> 35:55.760
This time…

35:58.240 --> 36:00.240
I really can't wait for you anymore.

36:34.560 --> 36:36.680
YUEBUHUAN INN

36:57.480 --> 36:58.520
Yaoting…

37:05.600 --> 37:06.920
We've come to this point.

37:07.440 --> 37:08.760
Don't hide the truth from me anymore.

37:11.720 --> 37:12.600
I know

37:13.600 --> 37:17.000
I can never dissuade you
from your decisions.

37:21.600 --> 37:23.000
Take this with you.

37:25.960 --> 37:27.600
- I don't need it, Yaoting.
- You should keep it.

37:27.680 --> 37:30.000
What bride goes to her wedding
without something for protection?

37:34.520 --> 37:35.600
Take it.

37:37.240 --> 37:38.080
Take it.

37:44.360 --> 37:46.200
Your brother is useless.

37:47.760 --> 37:49.200
This is all I can do

37:50.080 --> 37:51.400
for you.

37:54.160 --> 37:55.400
Thank you, Yaoting.

37:56.880 --> 37:59.080
Ms. Ji, it's time to leave.

37:59.800 --> 38:00.960
Don't miss the auspicious hour.

38:07.160 --> 38:08.800
After I get married,

38:09.440 --> 38:12.560
all matters of the household
are entrusted to you.

38:16.920 --> 38:18.040
Rest assured.

38:19.360 --> 38:20.760
May your journey ahead

38:21.800 --> 38:23.280
a harmonious family,

38:23.840 --> 38:25.160
a match made in heaven,

38:26.840 --> 38:28.200
and a long and happy life together.

38:40.200 --> 38:41.480
To my elder brother,

38:42.560 --> 38:43.960
I bid you farewell.

39:04.320 --> 39:05.320
Get up quickly.

40:54.840 --> 40:56.160
Mr. Yang,

40:56.240 --> 40:58.960
General Niu has sent me to take your head!

40:59.960 --> 41:01.360
Then, let's see

41:01.440 --> 41:03.800
if you have the skill to do so.

42:30.120 --> 42:31.400
Ta Xue!

42:37.520 --> 42:40.240
Speak. How many more troops are ahead?

42:46.440 --> 42:47.480
Speak!

42:48.560 --> 42:50.160
The main road to Yizhou is blocked.

42:50.760 --> 42:52.360
Every corner is filled with archers.

42:52.440 --> 42:53.880
They're waiting for you.
Escape is impossible.
